Third-party software
--------------------
- NumPy — BSD-3-Clause — https://numpy.org
- PyTorch — BSD-3-Clause — https://pytorch.org (optional: planner inference and training)

Model weights
-------------
- weights/planner.pt — Apache-2.0. Trained from scratch on procedurally
  generated data. No pretrained weights, no external audio.
- The optional detail model is NOT distributed with this repository. It was
  trained on ESC-50 and is released separately under CC BY-NC-4.0 for research
  use only. See weights/README.md.

Datasets
--------
- ESC-50 (Piczak, 2015), CC BY-NC-4.0, https://github.com/karolpiczak/ESC-50
  Used only to train the optional detail model. Not redistributed here.
- The planner training set (100k caption/Spec pairs) is generated by
  scripts/gen_scores.py and contains no third-party content.

